card c11
kind: teach
type: explain
tier: deeper
scored: 0
title: Go deeper: the line is not sharp
figure: ultraviolet-border
figure_at: 1

body:
    Ultraviolet light sits close to the line between the two groups. High-energy ultraviolet is ionizing, and lower-energy ultraviolet is not. Visible light is on the safe side of it.
